<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="PT-BR">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/termosCondicoes.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/dataBasic.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/address.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/schoolData.css" />
  <link rel="icon" href="images/favicon-16x16.png">
  <title>CIEEMG</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.1.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet"
    href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-select@1.13.14/dist/css/bootstrap-select.min.css" />
</head>

<body>
  <main class="screen-main">
    <div class="terms-and-conditions">
    </div>
    <div class="sub-main-title">
      <h1 class="h1-sub-title">Termos e condições</h1>
    </div>
    <nav class="screen screen-terms-conditions">
      <div class="termos-box">
        <p class="class-p">
          Prezado usuário, para continuar utilizando os serviços de nosso
          portal, você precisa primeiramente ler e aceitar os nossos termos e
          condições de uso. Clique no botão abaixo para acessar os termos.
        </p>
        <button type="button" class="button-termo">Leia os termos e condições</button>
        <div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <nav class="screen screen-basic-data1"></nav>
    <nav class="screen screen-address"></nav>
    <nav class="screen screen-school-data"></nav>
  </main>
  <nav class="fixed">
    <nav class="nav-bar position main">
      <div class="container main">
        <img class="main" src="images/CIEE-2023-atualizado.png" alt="Logo do CIEEMG" />
      </div>
      <div class="main-side main">
        <div id="item-terms-conditions">
          <button class="big-terms-conditions main"><img class="button-terms-conditions main" src="images/terms-32.png"
              alt="Termos e condições" />Termos e
            Condições</button>
        </div>
        <div id="item-data-basic">
          <button class="big-basic-data main"><img class="button-basic-data main" src="images/basic-data-32.png"
              alt="Dados básicos" />Dados
            Básicos</button>
        </div>
        <div id="item-address">
          <button type="submit" class="big-address main"><img class="button-address main" src="images/address-32.png"
              alt="Endereço" />Endereço</button>
        </div>
        <div id="item-school-data">
          <button class="big-school-data main"><img class="button-school-data main" src="images/school-data-32.png"
              alt="Dados acadêmicos" />Dados
            Acadêmicos</button>
        </div>
        <div id="item-socio-economic">
          <button class="big-socio-economic main"><img class="button-socio-economic main" src="images/school-data-32.png"
              alt="Avaliação social Socio-econômico" />Avaliação social Socio-econômico</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="main-side-mobile main">
        <div id="item-terms-conditions">
          <button class="main"><img class="button-terms-conditions main" src="images/terms-32.png"
              alt="Termos e condições" /></button>
        </div>
        <div id="item-data-basic">
          <button class="main"><img class="button-basic-data main" src="images/basic-data-32.png"
              alt="Dados básicos" /></button>
        </div>
        <div id="item-address">
          <button class="main"><img class="button-address main" src="images/address-32.png" alt="Endereço" /></button>
        </div>
        <div id="item-school-data">
          <button class="main"><img class="button-school-data main" src="images/school-data-32.png"
              alt="Dados acadêmicos" /></button>
        </div>
        <div id="item-socio-economic">
          <button class="main"><img class="button-socio-economic main" src="images/school-data-32.png"
              alt="Avaliação social Socio-econômico" /></button>
        </div>

      </div>
    </nav>
  </nav>
  <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.3.1.slim.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/popper.js@1.14.3/dist/umd/popper.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.1.3/dist/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-select@1.13.14/dist/js/bootstrap-select.min.js"></script>
  <script src="js/bundle.js"></script>
</body>

</html>